```

So when `d_m3CompileExtendedOpcode` is NOT defined, `Read_opcode` reads the 0xFC byte and the next byte, combining them into `opcode = (0xFC << 8) | next_byte = 0xFC00 | next_byte`.

Then in `Compile_BlockStatements`:
